<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Greenfield cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Greenfield cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it downgraded the rating on Greenfield Industries Inc to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares plunged 7-3/4 to 25-1/2.</p>
<p>-- earlier Thursday, the company said it expected fourth quarter diluted earnings to be between $0.32-$0.34 per share, below company expectations.</p>
</text>
